# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-27, R-12). L §2.3: field = FIELD ":" (slit | STR | hole | ...), slit = ["-"] lit: a
# row's record field may be a negative literal (refcore refused it at load, LOAD-UNIT, a fault). The fields read back as
# written.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input r: (a money PLN, b int, c num)
ask q: r.a, r.b, r.c

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  r = (a: -5.00 PLN, b: -3, c: -0.25)
=== expect
q: (-5.00 PLN, -3, -0.25)
  cut 2026-01-01
